# Copy this file to ".env.local" if you need to override a default, then
# restart the dev server. BOTH variables are OPTIONAL — the site works with
# no .env.local at all because it ships with sensible defaults.
#
# Lead delivery and the public calendar are handled by the IDJ Ops app
# (ops.idj.events). The contact form posts to same-origin /api/leads (rewritten
# to Ops). If Ops is briefly unreachable it falls back to opening the visitor's
# email app with their details pre-filled, so leads are never lost.

# Origin of the IDJ Ops app. Powers next.config.ts rewrites (/client, /static,
# /api/leads, /api/calendar) and the server-side calendar fetch.
# Ephemeral *.trycloudflare.com origins are ignored in favor of ops.idj.events.
# PORTAL_ORIGIN=https://ops.idj.events

# Browser-side lead endpoint for the contact form (defaults to relative /api/leads).
# Only set this if you need an absolute override.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT=/api/leads
